    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Is ITD GrowthLabs a skincare-specialist agency or a generic D2C agency?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Skincare + beauty is a named vertical for us. 4+ published D2C beauty brand case studies (<a href=\"/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php\">Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href=\"/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php\">Plum</a>, <a href=\"/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php\">Sugar</a>, <a href=\"/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php\">WOW Skin Science</a>) + 11 GCC city beauty pages + published Ayurveda + Male Grooming + Skincare playbooks + seasonal Summer + Winter Skincare Wellness playbooks. Skincare is category depth for us, not a category we handle occasionally."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which skincare sub-verticals do you specialise in?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Clean beauty + Ayurveda (Kama Ayurveda territory), Clinical + Dermatologist-led (The Ordinary + Minimalist + Foxtale territory), K-beauty adjacent + innovation (Foxtale + The Skin Story + Deconstruct territory), Men's grooming (Bombay Shaving + Beardo + Ustraa territory), Colour cosmetics + makeup (Sugar + Plum + MyGlamm territory), Halal + vegan + clean-label GCC (emerging + Vision 2030 tailwinds). Different funnels + creative + content per sub-vertical."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work with skincare brands only in India or also GCC + international?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "India + GCC as core markets. 11 city-specific beauty agency pages across UAE + Saudi + Qatar + Kuwait + Oman + Bahrain. Arabic + Hindi + English creative production, INR + AED + SAR pricing, halal-compliant messaging, and calendar-aware campaigns (Ramadan + Eid + Diwali + Dhanteras + wedding + seasonal winter/summer)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is a realistic marketing budget for a D2C skincare brand?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Rs 1.5-3 lakh / month all-in for founder-led boutique (Rs 15L-1.5 Cr revenue). Rs 3-10 lakh / month for mid-market (Rs 1.5-20 Cr). Rs 10-30 lakh+ / month for enterprise + multi-region. Ad spend on top of retainer &mdash; typical Rs 40K-Rs 4 lakh / month for boutique, Rs 2-15 lakh / month for mid-market, Rs 10-40 lakh+ / month for enterprise + luxury."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do you handle skincare subscription + retention?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Skincare subscription is a critical LTV lever &mdash; 3-5x LTV lift vs one-time purchase. We deploy Bold Subscriptions + Recharge + Shopify Subscriptions with refill cadence design + WhatsApp routine builder + refill reminders + winback flows. Retention pod tracks cohort retention + LTV + churn + reactivation metrics."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you build the Shopify store too?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Skincare-specific Shopify + WooCommerce builds &mdash; ingredient encyclopaedia + skin quiz + routine builder + subscription + refill flow + before-after gallery + review + UGC + dermatologist-endorsed sections + certification display (CDSCO + FDA). Sites take 4-10 weeks. Cost Rs 3-15 lakh."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about influencer + creator marketing for skincare?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Core capability. Dermatologist + esthetician + skincare-creator + micro + macro + celebrity tiers. Meta Branded Content Partner whitelisting + UGC rights + amplification into paid. Categories: clean beauty + clinical + K-beauty-adjacent + men's grooming + colour. Bridal + wedding creator partnerships also supported."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long before we see meaningful revenue lift?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "First qualified conversions within 2-3 weeks of launch. Meaningful monthly-revenue lift by month 3. SEO-driven organic compounding from month 4-6. Full brand + funnel maturity by month 9-12. Skincare subscription retention flywheel kicks in from month 6-9 driving LTV compounding."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which is more important for skincare D2C &mdash; Google Ads, Meta Ads, or SEO?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "All three, weighted by sub-vertical + stage. Clean beauty + Ayurveda: 35% Meta + 25% Google + 20% Instagram organic + 20% SEO + WhatsApp. Clinical + Dermatologist: 40% Meta + 30% Google Search + 15% content SEO + 15% influencer. K-beauty + Colour: 50% Meta + Instagram + Reels + 25% Google + 15% creator + 10% SEO. Men's grooming: 45% Meta + 25% Google + 20% creator + 10% SEO."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we start &mdash; what does the first call cover?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Book a free 30-minute discovery call via Calendly. We map your existing funnel + brand + collection + revenue + goals + share a customised proposal within 3 working days. Or WhatsApp us at +91-9930950940 with your Shopify URL or Instagram handle + current monthly ad spend + we send back a 1-page audit within 24 hours."}}]}</script>
